<title>UK: UK'S MARLEY BUYS U.S. FLOOR BUSINESS.</title>
<headline>UK'S MARLEY BUYS U.S. FLOOR BUSINESS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building and products group Marley Plc said on Monday it had agreed to buy the Flexco commercial flooring business of Robbins Inc for 24.8 million stg in cash.  </p>
<p>David Trapnell, chief executive of Marley, said: &quot;The addition of Flexco to the Group will enable us to compete much more effectively in the commercial flooring market both in North America and elsewhere.&quot;</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
